  {
    "id": "ex11-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "ex11-tab",
    "name": "Streamed circle via Move",
    "info": "No arc primitive — Function computes lat/lon ring points (§ coordinate frames). Move action Go to (altitude above home), delivery stream @ 5 Hz, TTL 1500 ms. The 0.2 s tick only emits while flow.circling is true: ◯ Fly circle sets it, ■ Stop circle clears it and sends {action:\"stop\"}, then TTL lets the setpoint lapse. SITL bind 14550 → 14551.",
